2>\n        <div>\n            This is a free website builder demo of the <a href="').concat(z.el,'" class="gjs-t-link" target="_blank">Studio SDK</a> library, allowing you to easily create and customize websites or landing pages, no coding required. Design freely, export your projects without restrictions, and deploy them anywhere you like.<br/>\n            <br/>\n            If you\'re looking to embed a similar builder in your product with custom functionality, feel free to <a class="gjs-t-link" href="').concat(z.vI,'" target="_blank" >reach out</a>!\n        </div>\n        <div data-gjs-type="flex-row" style="gap: 2%; margin-top: 2rem">\n            <div data-gjs-type="flex-column" style="flex-basis: 49%">\n              <a href="https://grapesjs.com" class="gjs-t-button button" target="_blank">\n                More about GrapesJS\n              </a>\n            </div>\n            <div data-gjs-type="flex-column" style="flex-basis: 49%">\n              <a href="').concat(z.el,'" class="gjs-t-button button" target="_blank">\n                Studio SDK Docs\n              </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class="footer">Happy building! \uD83D\uDE80</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer style="height: 200px"></footer>\n  </body>\n  <style>\n      body {\n        background-color: #e7e7e7;\n        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n      }\n      .head {\n        padding: 50px 50px 35px;\n      }\n      .logo {\n        height: 50px;\n        display: block;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      .card {\n        max-width: 700px;\n        padding: 40px 45px;\n        background-color: white;\n        border-radius: 15px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      .title {\n        margin: 0;\n        text-align: center;\n      }\n      .subtitle {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 25px 0;\n      }\n      .paragraph {\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        margin-bottom: 40px;\n      }\n      .link {\n        c